# 4. Repository Structure

The repository is a monorepo containing the backend API, frontend SPA, ingestion pipeline, database schema bootstrap, and local development tooling.

| **obs/ ├── backend/                     # FastAPI application │   ├── app/ │   │   ├── main.py              # FastAPI app entry point │   │   ├── auth/                # Auth middleware (Entra ID + local bypass) │   │   ├── routers/             # API route modules (one per domain) │   │   ├── services/            # Business logic and calculation service │   │   │   ├── calculation_service.py │   │   │   └── notification_service.py │   │   ├── db/                  # Database access layer (DuckDB local / PostgreSQL prod) │   │   └── models/              # Pydantic request/response models │   ├── pipeline/                # Ingestion pipeline scripts │   │   ├── actuals_pipeline.py │   │   ├── employees_pipeline.py │   │   └── hierarchy_pipeline.py │   ├── tests/ │   │   ├── unit/ │   │   ├── integration/ │   │   └── fixtures/            # Sample CSV/Excel files for pipeline tests │   ├── requirements.txt │   └── requirements-dev.txt ├── frontend/                    # React TypeScript SPA │   ├── src/ │   │   ├── components/          # All React components (mirroring UX spec sections) │   │   ├── contexts/            # React contexts (ObsUserContext, BudgetWorkflowContext) │   │   ├── hooks/               # Custom hooks │   │   ├── services/            # API client functions │   │   └── types/               # TypeScript type definitions │   ├── public/ │   ├── vite.config.ts │   ├── tsconfig.json │   └── package.json ├── schema/                      # PostgreSQL / DuckDB schema definitions │   ├── bootstrap.sql            # CREATE TABLE statements for all obs.* tables │   └── seed/                    # Seed data scripts for local development ├── local-data/                  # Git-ignored local data directory │   ├── landing-zone/            # Substitute for Azure Blob Storage landing zone │   │   ├── actuals/ │   │   ├── employees/ │   │   └── hierarchies/ │   ├── archive/ │   ├── error/ │   └── obs.duckdb               # Local DuckDB database file ├── .vscode/ │   ├── extensions.json          # Recommended extensions │   ├── settings.json            # Workspace settings │   └── launch.json              # Debug configurations ├── .env.local.example           # Template for local environment variables ├── .gitignore ├── Makefile                     # Developer convenience commands └── README.md** |
| --- |

